scope: a file-backed Rerun.Versions, so a version tree outlives the process. One JSON file per version under a directory, readable by hand; the on-disk shape is its own model (not the internal types) so the format is a decision rather than an accident. Lineage still walks by parent pointer. Files: okay-agent Rerun.scala (a FileVersions beside MemoryVersions), TestRerun, specs/llm-agentic.md.
